  "reasoning": "The claim is a well-documented myth. The Great Wall of China is virtually invisible to the naked human eye from low Earth orbit because it is typically only 6 to 9 meters wide and constructed of materials that blend into the surrounding terrain. Furthermore, astronauts and space agencies like NASA have confirmed that it cannot be seen without magnification, whereas several other man-made structures (such as major highways, large airports, dams, and city lights at night) can be seen from orbit.",
